This story is a work of fiction.

00:01:33.890 --> 00:01:37.560
October, 1584 - Kyoto

00:01:49.850 --> 00:01:52.180
What is he doing?

00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:53.530
I wonder...

00:02:03.550 --> 00:02:05.270
Are you repainting this?

00:02:05.380 --> 00:02:06.230
Yes.

00:02:06.420 --> 00:02:09.400
It was quite flamboyant before, and frankly, embarrassing.

00:02:09.500 --> 00:02:13.120
I see. This works in its own way.

00:02:13.700 --> 00:02:17.750
I have also made my shop look a bit aged.

00:02:17.840 --> 00:02:20.840
Now business is booming.

00:02:21.230 --> 00:02:26.160
This street has taken in the benevolence of wilted wood.

00:02:32.360 --> 00:02:34.600
Murmurs of Separation

00:02:35.870 --> 00:02:38.560
Your way with the tea is superb.

00:02:39.970 --> 00:02:42.200
Ever since you cut off your topknot,

00:02:42.280 --> 00:02:44.900
you seem to have turned over a new leaf.

00:02:45.020 --> 00:02:46.690
Hosokawa Tadaoki-dono.

00:02:47.520 --> 00:02:50.670
I have learned much from my master.

00:02:52.100 --> 00:02:57.510
Even in practice, I have used the exact same black tea cup.

00:02:57.670 --> 00:03:02.530
But now I finally understand the true beauty in pure nothingness.

00:03:04.320 --> 00:03:07.050
That cup is different from the one before.

00:03:09.180 --> 00:03:12.280
I also mistook it as the same one...

00:03:12.540 --> 00:03:18.290
Like how the pillars on the Chinese-style bridges at Seta have individual emblems,

00:03:19.160 --> 00:03:24.320
at first glance they may seem similar, but they are different.

00:03:25.930 --> 00:03:34.390
As a man of tea, what is important lies in finding beauty hidden within all things.

00:03:42.630 --> 00:03:45.540
Excuse me for taking a leave during the lesson.

00:03:45.650 --> 00:03:47.690
Where did you go?

00:03:48.250 --> 00:03:50.700
Our lesson is about to end.

00:03:52.880 --> 00:03:57.300
Master spoke of the emblems on the Chinese-style bridges of Seta.

00:03:57.490 --> 00:04:02.210
Were you implying the one facing west, the third pillar on the side of the lake?

00:04:03.530 --> 00:04:05.390
That is correct.

00:04:08.160 --> 00:04:11.350
You rode there to check it out!?

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:15.590
I cannot sit still at the utterance of beauty.

00:04:16.590 --> 00:04:18.960
You get this "whoosh" feeling.

00:04:19.130 --> 00:04:23.150
Perhaps it is similar to the feeling of stroking your head, Tadaoki-dono.

00:04:24.720 --> 00:04:27.220
I am complimenting your cute looks.

00:04:27.560 --> 00:04:29.450
Hosokawa "Mr. Emblem."

00:04:35.550 --> 00:04:39.750
I am amazed by your curiosity and motivation, Furuta-dono.

00:04:40.270 --> 00:04:43.580
I, Gamon Matsuhide, have much work to do.

00:04:45.360 --> 00:04:48.330
Even in these turbulent times,

00:04:48.470 --> 00:04:56.390
I would hope for everyone to be like Furuta-sama, with the heart of an aesthete.

00:05:06.100 --> 00:05:08.480
You want to show me something?

00:05:08.760 --> 00:05:13.030
I have finally received what I wanted.

00:05:13.220 --> 00:05:16.740
Please have a look.

00:05:34.580 --> 00:05:36.720
What a nice color.

00:05:37.140 --> 00:05:40.690
In Nanban, they call this color olive.

00:05:44.560 --> 00:05:46.880
Quite a fresh color.

00:05:48.030 --> 00:05:49.290
Olive.

00:06:10.440 --> 00:06:11.570
Brother.

00:06:14.330 --> 00:06:18.870
One year has passed since Brother Nakagawa Kiyohide-dono's death.

00:06:20.680 --> 00:06:22.090
How ironic.

00:06:22.830 --> 00:06:25.490
I have given up on the path of a warrior,

00:06:26.810 --> 00:06:30.000
but now I serve as the eldest son, Hidemasa-dono's guardian.

00:06:30.310 --> 00:06:33.150
I earn 12,000 koku now.

00:06:34.630 --> 00:06:39.640
Brother was an amazing warrior fitting of that painting.

00:06:40.390 --> 00:06:43.150
This may be putting great pressure on you, who just had your rite of passage,

00:06:44.020 --> 00:06:47.470
but you have to protect the Nakagawa family.

00:06:48.390 --> 00:06:50.810
I know.

00:06:51.930 --> 00:06:55.310
I came back from the front lines for this ceremony,

00:06:56.520 --> 00:06:58.800
but I will be right back to attacking Tokugawa.

00:06:59.230 --> 00:07:02.260
I shall finish what I started.

00:07:02.560 --> 00:07:06.360
So strong at such a young age...

00:07:09.160 --> 00:07:11.220
Compared to that...

00:07:11.950 --> 00:07:13.720
Our children...

00:07:15.610 --> 00:07:20.670
The Furuta family should be the one asking Hidemasa-dono for help.

00:07:21.030 --> 00:07:24.610
November, 1584 - Ise Province, Kobe

00:07:41.640 --> 00:07:44.560
Furuta Sasuke is here to see you.

00:07:44.820 --> 00:07:46.380
Tell him to come in.

00:07:50.420 --> 00:07:53.320
I can not stand that Ieyasu.

00:07:53.730 --> 00:07:57.150
It has been half a year already.

00:07:57.250 --> 00:07:59.610
But he has no desire to retreat.

00:08:00.860 --> 00:08:02.110
If I may interject,

00:08:02.440 --> 00:08:06.670
Tokugawa challenges our 100,000 men with a mere 15,000 men.

00:08:07.210 --> 00:08:11.230
At Komaki and Nagakute, we will taste victory.

00:08:11.980 --> 00:08:13.930
He has no intention of retreating before then.

00:08:14.010 --> 00:08:17.160
Correction, 16,000 men.

00:08:18.050 --> 00:08:22.230
With Oda Nobukatsu's forces, they number 16,000 men.

00:08:22.740 --> 00:08:27.730
You have to be accurate in your numbers when reporting to the lord.

00:08:28.770 --> 00:08:31.040
Excuse me for my error, Ishida-dono.

00:08:31.240 --> 00:08:33.360
Enough of that, Mitsunari.

00:08:34.990 --> 00:08:39.940
I had no intention of listening to Sasuke's analysis.

00:08:40.100 --> 00:08:40.960
I see.

00:08:44.850 --> 00:08:46.690
It has been two years since Akechi's downfall.

00:08:47.220 --> 00:08:50.410
I have finally defeated Shibata Katsuie.

00:08:50.620 --> 00:08:53.400
I thought that was the end of the Oda family.

00:08:53.590 --> 00:08:56.980
But now Nobukatsu teams up with Ieyasu!?

00:09:00.930 --> 00:09:06.450
My body cannot take any more of this drawn out war.

00:09:06.890 --> 00:09:09.250
I would rather focus my efforts on bearing offspring,

00:09:09.410 --> 00:09:12.530
and having tea with the prized goods I have gathered.

00:09:12.730 --> 00:09:13.490
Well then.

00:09:13.600 --> 00:09:15.210
Why did you call me here?

00:09:15.930 --> 00:09:17.980
We are about to make peace with Nobukatsu.

00:09:18.210 --> 00:09:21.940
Tell that to Ieyasu.

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:29.610
If we gain peace, Ieyasu will lose his reason to fight.

00:09:30.130 --> 00:09:32.590
This may delay my rule over the Eastern provinces,

00:09:32.930 --> 00:09:36.980
but as long as I control Kyoto, I shall have many ways.

00:09:37.270 --> 00:09:40.760
Will this not strengthen Ieyasu?

00:09:41.010 --> 00:09:44.450
I believe we should stand firm and not retreat.

00:09:44.920 --> 00:09:47.030
That is why I called Sasuke here.

00:09:49.120 --> 00:09:53.670
If I leave things to that stubborn head of yours, things will get ugly.

00:09:56.400 --> 00:09:57.890
Please, Sasuke!

00:09:58.470 --> 00:10:01.340
Use your abilities like how you made Nobunaga-sama laugh out loud!

00:10:01.470 --> 00:10:03.320
Have Ieyasu retreat!

00:10:10.870 --> 00:10:12.420
You piece of shit!

00:10:18.820 --> 00:10:21.450
This is too heavy of a responsibility to bear.

00:10:24.690 --> 00:10:25.580
Look.

00:10:46.890 --> 00:10:48.170
Is that...!

00:10:49.850 --> 00:10:51.540
One of the triumverate!

00:10:52.670 --> 00:10:53.670
Hatsuhana!

00:10:55.610 --> 00:11:00.610
When we defeated Shibata, Ieyasu gave this to me.

00:11:01.000 --> 00:11:03.600
He gave me something amazing.

00:11:03.980 --> 00:11:08.830
This means Ieyasu does not wish to fight me from the bottom of his heart.

00:11:15.350 --> 00:11:19.290
Seems like you still hold a place in your heart for these famous goods.

00:11:21.830 --> 00:11:28.510
If you succeed, I can lend this to you for a few hours.

00:11:48.490 --> 00:11:52.120
Mid-November - Owari Province, Kiyosuji Castle

00:12:00.280 --> 00:12:04.350
Nagamatsu recognizes the Hatsuhana. He will understand how you feel.

00:12:06.700 --> 00:12:09.100
Forget about its status as one of the triumverate.

00:12:09.500 --> 00:12:12.120
That slick amber colored smoothness...

00:12:12.260 --> 00:12:15.110
That finished glaze alike droplets of the landscape...

00:12:15.270 --> 00:12:17.440
Its simplicity is unmatched.

00:12:18.120 --> 00:12:21.780
My heart beats with anticipation just thinking of borrowing it.

00:12:22.730 --> 00:12:25.110
You have not changed at all, Furusa.

00:12:27.460 --> 00:12:29.780
We are both the same.

00:12:31.500 --> 00:12:33.330
Hey! Restrain yourself!

00:12:36.570 --> 00:12:39.770
Oda Nagamasu! I have brought Hashiba's messenger.

00:12:40.090 --> 00:12:41.840
We would like an audience with Ieyasu-dono!

00:12:42.480 --> 00:12:43.540
Please wait.

00:12:46.650 --> 00:12:49.810
Hashiba-dono may have made peace with Nobukatsu-dono.

00:12:49.910 --> 00:12:52.150
But I was your enemy until yesterday.

00:12:54.040 --> 00:12:56.720
Do not have them sense our true relationship.

00:12:57.510 --> 00:13:00.550
As expected of a man who has gone through everything.

00:13:00.990 --> 00:13:03.440
He has perfected the art of survival.

00:13:07.340 --> 00:13:10.360
Hashiba comes to me on his own? That is great.

00:13:10.660 --> 00:13:14.400
Our men cannot take the toll, the longer the war drags on.

00:13:15.010 --> 00:13:18.960
But we must not show a single instant of weakness.

00:13:19.490 --> 00:13:21.670
Treat our guests well.

00:13:21.930 --> 00:13:24.770
Show them we mean business.

00:13:25.520 --> 00:13:27.730
We shall bring out our very best.

00:13:28.030 --> 00:13:30.640
Even the highest of royalty will be surprised.

00:13:31.350 --> 00:13:32.260
In the future,

00:13:32.500 --> 00:13:34.810
if Tokugawa rebels against Hashiba,

00:13:34.950 --> 00:13:38.140
and stabilizes the peace with the East as the starting point,

00:13:38.470 --> 00:13:42.710
then we must become as sly as a fox or a racoon.

00:13:44.100 --> 00:13:48.110
Ieyasu-sama is still too honest.

00:13:49.150 --> 00:13:51.870
Is that not the reason we chose to follow him?

00:13:54.350 --> 00:13:56.080
No need for you to tell me that.

00:14:25.830 --> 00:14:29.790
I have heard from Nagamasu about making peace.

00:14:31.040 --> 00:14:33.000
What does Hashiba Hideyoshi think?

00:14:33.710 --> 00:14:38.850
I would like for Tokugawa-dono to sign an armistice.

00:14:39.590 --> 00:14:45.020
Hashiba shall remove all of his troops then.

00:15:03.600 --> 00:15:05.440
All right. I understand.

00:15:06.680 --> 00:15:11.970
Pardon my rudeness during the banquet at Azuchi Castle during Nobunaga's reign.

00:15:13.690 --> 00:15:17.260
I have learned your hosting ways.

00:15:33.660 --> 00:15:36.710
Please enjoy.

00:15:52.780 --> 00:15:56.500
We keep telling ourselves to be thrifty,

00:15:56.640 --> 00:15:59.070
but this war has been too easy.

00:15:59.110 --> 00:16:01.590
Look at how much food we have left over!

00:16:07.080 --> 00:16:09.930
Come on now, this is not poisoned.

00:16:10.030 --> 00:16:11.820
Enjoy yourselves.

00:16:12.210 --> 00:16:17.200
Even in Kyoto, you are not able to eat such delicacies.

00:16:21.690 --> 00:16:23.860
Delicacies?

00:16:29.150 --> 00:16:33.100
How dare you call this explosion of rice a delicacy?

00:16:43.110 --> 00:16:46.230
The banquet Master and I had set up...

00:16:46.470 --> 00:16:48.780
Do these fools even understand!?

00:16:50.820 --> 00:16:55.060
To celebrate the coming of the end of the war, let me perform.

00:16:55.170 --> 00:16:58.800
Here it is! Sakai-sama's shrimp mongering dance!

00:17:02.930 --> 00:17:04.620
~ Oh! ~

00:17:04.690 --> 00:17:07.790
~ Out in the great seas... ~

00:17:07.880 --> 00:17:11.270
~ The moonlight reflects the waves. ~

00:17:11.340 --> 00:17:12.650
~ Shrimp mongering! ~

00:17:12.700 --> 00:17:14.670
~ Go! Go! Go! ~

00:17:15.740 --> 00:17:17.330
~ Go! Go! ~

00:17:18.370 --> 00:17:19.990
I have come here...

00:17:21.990 --> 00:17:27.720
...representing Hashiba's 100,000 men!

00:17:31.970 --> 00:17:33.350
I cannot lose!

00:17:37.730 --> 00:17:39.100
Do not let your anger take over.

00:17:39.360 --> 00:17:43.180
If you go buck wild now, this meeting will be for naught.

00:18:06.790 --> 00:18:08.940
But this is hilarious.

00:18:09.080 --> 00:18:11.030
Why am I laughing?

00:18:11.770 --> 00:18:13.140
Is it because they are doing their best?

00:18:16.190 --> 00:18:20.390
It is not just because of their comedic act.

00:18:24.760 --> 00:18:26.930
They are showing off their unwavering spirit.

00:18:27.050 --> 00:18:30.070
They are putting up an act with their lives on the line. That is hilarious.

00:18:32.870 --> 00:18:37.380
Only a discerning eye can pick out the sense of humor.

00:18:37.850 --> 00:18:41.740
But now my rage has subsided.

00:18:45.120 --> 00:18:46.150
Master.

00:18:47.410 --> 00:18:52.170
The true meaning of elegance comes when least expected.

00:19:15.260 --> 00:19:17.190
Small plates made of Iga pottery?

00:19:21.600 --> 00:19:26.730
If this has been a true banquet, the plates would have been one-use only.

00:19:26.950 --> 00:19:30.680
But Tokugawa is a simple man, hence these plates.

00:19:32.990 --> 00:19:37.900
Compared to the transience of those plates, these seem quite prudent.

00:19:38.460 --> 00:19:40.320
The pottery from Iga

00:19:40.370 --> 00:19:43.810
is famous for using high-quality clay with a certain frog-eye look.

00:19:48.170 --> 00:19:52.130
Truly a waste to use these here.

00:19:53.060 --> 00:19:55.280
Someone needs to save you.

00:20:03.390 --> 00:20:07.000
Thank you for such a grand reception.

00:20:08.060 --> 00:20:13.260
I shall report to Hashiba-sama of the armistice.

00:20:17.640 --> 00:20:19.530
Here is a little something.

00:20:31.540 --> 00:20:34.990
It is a tea scoop that I have made myself.

00:20:35.370 --> 00:20:40.260
I hope one day I can pay you back for today.

00:20:43.180 --> 00:20:43.920
I take my leave!

00:21:01.780 --> 00:21:04.410
His every move is very weighted.

00:21:07.860 --> 00:21:10.060
Just like what that man said prior to his death.

00:21:14.880 --> 00:21:16.360
Great job.

00:21:16.880 --> 00:21:19.510
You gave away the Hatsuhana first.

00:21:19.810 --> 00:21:22.550
That lessened their hostility.

00:21:23.380 --> 00:21:25.890
Even though this war has no winner,

00:21:26.030 --> 00:21:29.180
we did not retreat against the might of Hashiba's army.

00:21:30.060 --> 00:21:34.260
We have displayed to the world Tokugawa's strength.

00:21:35.760 --> 00:21:41.330
But I felt I have lost in the end.

00:21:45.390 --> 00:21:50.340
I had a burst of temper at the banquet at Azuchi Castle.

00:21:50.610 --> 00:21:54.010
He was able to hold his rage.

00:21:59.850 --> 00:22:06.620
Furuta Sasuke may be someone special.

00:22:12.640 --> 00:22:16.250
You seemed to have learned the art of survival, Furuta.

00:22:17.850 --> 00:22:21.780
I would not want another one of Tokugawa's invitations.

00:22:22.010 --> 00:22:24.870
You should pay more attention to the art of elegance.

00:22:27.430 --> 00:22:31.600
I attained something worth much more than my patience.

00:23:03.430 --> 00:23:06.160
Everytime I　

00:23:03.430 --> 00:23:06.160
Anata no mune

00:23:06.320 --> 00:23:08.550
feel your heart

00:23:06.320 --> 00:23:08.550
Fureru sonotabi

00:23:09.280 --> 00:23:14.640
Your burning, sincere passion singes me.

00:23:09.280 --> 00:23:14.640
Yakedoshisou na shinshi na jounetsu

00:23:15.560 --> 00:23:20.820
Were the world to turn against you, my dear love

00:23:15.560 --> 00:23:20.820
Sekai juu wo teki ni mawashitatte

00:23:21.670 --> 00:23:26.980
Opppose its rotation and return to me.

00:23:21.670 --> 00:23:26.980
Mezashitanara douzo tsuranuite kudasai

00:23:27.820 --> 00:23:33.070
Men are alike butterflies, as women are alike flowers.

00:23:27.820 --> 00:23:33.070
Otoko wa chouchou de onna wa hana de

00:23:34.070 --> 00:23:36.950
Through heaven and earth,

00:23:34.070 --> 00:23:36.950
Kuu to daichi to demo

00:23:37.180 --> 00:23:40.530
Are also alike, we all choose to live.

00:23:37.180 --> 00:23:40.530
Onaji asu wo eraberuno

00:23:40.730 --> 00:23:46.400
Should we be seperated by the flow of time?

00:23:40.730 --> 00:23:46.400
Toki ni nagasare kyouri ni hanasareru

00:23:46.500 --> 00:23:49.400
We must continue living our lives

00:23:46.500 --> 00:23:49.400
Kizuna nante kizunajynai

00:23:49.480 --> 00:23:52.010
Without each other.

00:23:49.480 --> 00:23:52.010
Omoumama ikite　

00:23:52.100 --> 00:23:52.970
You should

00:23:52.100 --> 00:23:52.970
Soshite

00:23:53.060 --> 00:23:58.470
Ascend the heavens and look below.

00:23:53.060 --> 00:23:58.470
Nobotta itadakikara mieru

00:23:58.580 --> 00:24:02.260
Show me the scenery in my dreams.

00:23:58.580 --> 00:24:02.260
Keshiki wo oshiete itsuka

00:24:02.320 --> 00:24:07.970
Even though we fall in love and drown in passion,

00:24:02.320 --> 00:24:07.970
Koi ni ochiteku ai ni oboreteku

00:24:08.050 --> 00:24:14.460
I desire my wish fulfilled, above this happiness we both share.

00:24:08.050 --> 00:24:14.460
Watashi no kono shiawase yori kanaetai negai sore wa

00:24:14.520 --> 00:24:20.260
I desire your pursuit of beautiful things.

00:24:14.520 --> 00:24:20.260
Anata no ou utsukushii mono

00:24:21.740 --> 00:24:26.240
So abide by my desire, for eternity.

00:24:21.740 --> 00:24:26.240
Kowasarenaide eien ni

00:24:36.070 --> 00:24:37.720
Under the five of you I have been reborn as Furuta Oribe!

00:24:41.750 --> 00:24:43.320
You failure of a son!

00:24:48.340 --> 00:24:50.100
Nipples.

00:24:50.330 --> 00:24:52.480
Changing Man.

00:24:53.260 --> 00:24:57.860
To be an aesthete or a warrior? That is the question.

00:24:56.410 --> 00:24:59.500
Changing Man
